al level instead of the population level?<br><br>gl &lt;- <a href=\"http://testset.gl\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://testset.gl&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792457787728000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2LKV4wxLUsFDX2r6IZzK5d\">testset.gl</a><br>nInd(gl) # 250 individuals<br>nPop(gl) # 30 populations<br>gl.tree.nj(gl) #  display genetic similarity between populations in the form of a phenetic tree <br><br>In this example, I would like to create a phylogenetic tree of individuals (n = 250), not populations (n = 30)<br><br>Kind regards,<br>Nicholas<br></blockquote></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p></blockquote></div>"
